Subject: GrindstoneListener: Replace SchedulerUtils.runTaskLater with player EntityScheduler

AE PATCH REASON: SchedulerUtils.runTaskLater makes code incompatible with Folia region-threaded architecture and crashes at runtime (UnsupportedOperationException from stripped SchedulerUtils or direct Bukkit.getScheduler() call rejected by Folia).
AE PATCH FIX: Replace both SchedulerUtils.runTaskLater calls with event.getWhoClicked().getScheduler().runDelayed(Core.getInstance(), ..., null, 1L) so the delayed grindstone handling runs on the player's region thread. Add ScheduledTask and Core imports. Add explicit type to Entry loop. Rename obfuscated vars.
AE PATCH RISK: LOW - MIGRATE: SchedulerUtils → EntityScheduler. RF: var rename. No behavior change.

